<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Software/SbomType/analyzed> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "SBOM generated through analysis of artifacts (e.g., executables, packages, containers, and virtual machine images) after its build. Such analysis generally requires a variety of heuristics. In some contexts, this may also be referred to as a \"3rd party\" SBOM."@en .
